&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt;②図書カード&lt;/p&gt;
